Z||000000||sluppy123||01-27-2001||10:30 PM||||Anyone that's planning on recovering their firewall panel with vinyl, pay special attention to the corners where the center console meets the firewall. If you cut the corners to deep like the original carpet was it will show around the edge of the console.<BR> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11172186&p=39326006&Sequence=0"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=11172186&p=39326099&Sequence=0"> <BR>Note: this is from personal experiance, It's tough pulling vinyl off fresh stiky glue.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT-Leather, Lowered and On The Bottle<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=7653930&p=37756786&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
